<title>LATVIA: DAUGAVPILS CHAIN IN 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>DAUGAVPILS CHAIN IN 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading secondary market share Daugavpils Chain made a 1996 net profit of 1.06 million lats, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement of results released on behalf of the company that the company's gross profit was 2.31 million lats and profit before taxes and extraordinary items was 1.0 million lats.</p>
<p>The company had assets of 8.44 million lats, the bourse added.</p>
<p>No comparative figures for the company were provided.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
